  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-69-1" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Course on Security Sector Reform for the V4 countries and Ukraine - SV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Kurz o Security Sector Reform pre krajiny V4 a Ukrajinu - &#x160;N</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;Kurz&#xa0;sl&#xfa;&#x17e;i ako &#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed; krok v prehlbovan&#xed; poznatkov ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch expertov z oblasti SSR. Ich poznatky bud&#xfa; m&#xf4;c&#x165; by&#x165; n&#xe1;sledne vyu&#x17e;it&#xe9; v r&#xe1;mci vlastn&#xe9;ho procesu zav&#xe1;dzania reforiem. Ke&#x10f;&#x17e;e Ukrajina je pravideln&#xfd;m prispievate&#x13e;om v r&#xe1;mci OSN do peacekeeping a peacebuilding oper&#xe1;ci&#xed;, nadobudnut&#xe9; sk&#xfa;senosti ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch partnerov m&#xf4;&#x17e;u by&#x165; rovnako vyu&#x17e;it&#xe9; aj v&#xa0;r&#xe1;mci vysielania ukrajinsk&#xfd;ch expertov do &#x10f;al&#x161;&#xed;ch tak&#xfd;chto misi&#xed;.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; align=&quot;justify&quot;&gt;The aim of the&#xa0;course&#xa0;is a&#xa0;further step in&#xa0;incresing the knowledge of experts in the Ukrainian SSR. Their knowledge&#xa0;can&#xa0;be used within the actual process of implementation of reforms. Whereas Ukraine is a regular contributor to the UN peacekeeping and peacebuilding operations, lessons learned Ukrainian partners can also be used in sending of Ukrainian experts to other&#xa0;missions with this topic.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
